hat was quite an interview with Rand Paul.\par \par \uc2 GREG GUTFELD, FOX NEWS CHANNEL HOST: Yes, she threw a picture up. Remember when she was called, like, America's sweetheart? Do we have a picture of her? She's gone from America's sweetheart to America's duck. Look at those like bizarro lips.\par \par \uc2 By the way, 300 -- they found 3,300 kids. I think we know where they belong, the Somali daycare. We couldn't find him for the -- you know when Homan talks about mistakes being made, I don't think he's talking about ICE because finding missing kids is not a mistake. It would have been interesting if he said, you know, we're going to stop looking for missing kids. And the Democrats go, oh, that's great. They probably would, because they hate good things that happen under Republicans. He was talking about the lack of cooperation, and he got the cooperation because that's the only thing -- that's the only thing that's changed, really, is that they're cooperating.\par \par \uc2 And so, people go, oh, you know, they've -- you know, they've admitted they did wrong. No, he didn't. He did like, 80 percent of the job.\par \par \uc2 Katie is a moron. The question is, how long has she been a moron? I mean, we were told that she was a subjective news source, but she made -- she just does such a disservice to women because they already have this stereotype that they can't do math and this -- and this is an idiot.\par \par \uc2 I mean, 14 percent is small. I mean, if 14 percent of your plate of pasta is ground up glass, would you eat it? I mean, she understands cancer. You know, one tumor is a billion cells. You got 33 trillion cells. That's 0.003 percent but that's not a big deal. She's an idiot. She's an idiot. It's 14 percent of, what 400,000 that's 50,000 violent felons, that's rapists, murderers, pedophiles.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the nonviolent ones that she's not talking about, those are guys that deal with child porn. They're fraudsters, they're drunk drivers, the