ne. Remember, he was on the border with \uc2 Burisma\uc2 , no experience in energy, oil, gas, Ukraine, was getting paid millions.\par \par \uc2 But according to Joe, he never -- I never once spoke to my son, my brother or anybody for that matter about their foreign business deals, in spite of what looks like evidence to the contrary, you know, pictures I guess he just, you know, pulled out -- pulled 2014 out of a hat. That was that was a random year, just like he randomly pressured Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Remember he bragged about it about withholding billions in aid until they agreed to fire the prosecutor investigating his zero experienced son being paid millions and \uc2 Burisma\uc2 ? Or the more likely scenario, that was the real quid pro quo with Ukraine, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  was just lying through his teeth as always.\par \par \uc2 Think about this, 2014, that start date also happens to cover Hunter's sweetheart deal with, oh, the Bank of China, another deal with the state- run Chinese energy company, CEFC. Remember the WhatsApp message, I'm sitting here next to my dad, remember that part?\par \par \uc2 And more sketchy deals, you know, with oligarchs from Kazakhstan, a generous $3.5 million wire transfer from the former first lady of Moscow, Elena Baturina, remember her, as documented by the joint report from the Senate Finance and Homeland Security Committees.\par \par \uc2 The pardon also covering allegations of tax evasion, money laundering, FARA violations, and even federal bribery corruption charges, that surrounded, you know, the -- what, 10 percent for the big guy or half my money goes to pops. But can the big guy sleep easy tonight? That's a legal question.\par \par \uc2 Is the Biden family syndicate officially in the clear? What about all the money Hunter says he gave to pops? Half my income goes to pops, it was on the laptop from hell.\par \par \uc2 Did other monies that he took in go to his brother? Maybe wives involved, maybe ex-wives involved, what