e most consequential election in a generation. My district will be the deciding factor in control of the House.\par \par \uc2 And if people want to support us, they should go to Lawlerforcongress.com, or text Lawler to 85007 to make sure we keep control of the House.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: What do you say to people who want to know why President Trump is spending time in New York 13 days out?\par \par \uc2 LAWLER: Listen, as any true New Yorker, you love to go to the garden. It's the most famous arena in the world.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: Everybody had to grow and play in the garden, right?\par \par \uc2 LAWLER: Absolutely. So, you know, look, obviously, this is the last election that he's going to be partaking in. So, it doesn't surprise me that he wants to close out at the garden.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: Well, I think he's a New Yorker at heart.\par \par \uc2 LAWLER: Yes.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: And I think he's excited to come back to \uc2 Madison Square Garden\uc2  and be the headliner. As you say, every New Yorker grows up with that dream. So we're going to watch that. It's going to be interesting on Sunday. Thank you, Mike Lawler.\par \par \uc2 LAWLER: Thanks, Martha.\par \par \uc2 MACCALLUM: Congressman, good to see you. New York 17, we'll watch that race on election night.\par \par \uc2 That is The Story for this Wednesday. Thank you for joining us today. New episode of The Untold Story podcast is my conversation with the CEO and co- founder of the Hallow App. And if you don't know the Hallow App, I really encourage you to check it out. Millions of people around the world have tuned in to find a new way to pray.\par \par \uc2 And it is really on fire this app, you should check it out. Fox news podcast.com, my conversation with him. We'll see you back here tomorrow. Have a great night.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2024 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2024 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  mate