blican areas of South Georgia and North Georgia, is coming on like no tomorrow. So right now, Georgia is looking pretty good for Trump.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: And Matt really quickly, Nevada looks like there could be some warning signs for Harris in Nevada, which is -- people always talk about, you know, Harry Reid's old, you know, Mafia there that would just lock it down for the Democrats. But Newsweek is saying that said the warning signs there with Republicans holding an unexpected lead after the first three days of early and mail in voting. Is that a big deal or overstated?\par \par \uc2 TOWERY: Well, we all know that culinary union there has so much power in the way the votes held in Nevada, it's always hard for a Republican to win. But I will say this, if you start to see Trump pick off other states, we never thought he could get, the Nevada is on the table as well. There's just a general flow of votes right now, and it's small within a certain area. African-American votes, Hispanic votes, they're all moving more towards Trump just as we get to these last two weeks.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Right now, I'd rather be Trump than Harris any day of the week if I were running. Matt, thank you so much. All right, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  just said he wants to lock Trump up. Yeah, brand new video. Next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: It's official. They're out of ideas.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA: He's a genuine threat to our democracy. That's not hyperbole. That is a God's truth. And folks, it's not just him. It's the people who are around him. These MAGA Republicans mean what they say. They genuinely mean what they say.\par \par \uc2 KAMALA HARRIS\uc2 , VICE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA: Just imagine now. \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  with no guardrails. Someone who suggests that we should terminate the Constitution of the United States.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO 