ood evening, everyone. I'm Laura Ingraham. This is The Ingraham Angle from Washington tonight. Thank you, as always, for being with us. All right, more signs today that with only 18 days to go, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  may be losing steam, and now she's desperately parroting a new media talking point, Trump. He's exhausted.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 KAMALA HARRIS\uc2 , VICE PRESIDENT OF THE U.S., (D) PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE: Now, he is ducking debates and canceling interviews. Come on. And check this out, his own campaign team recently said, it is because of exhaustion. Well, if you are exhausted on the campaign trail, it raises real questions about whether you are fit for the toughest job in the world. Come on, come on.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: I mean the hypocrisy of this woman who covered up for \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 's decline for years, and who hid from the campaign trail to prepare for her first debate. Trump is exhausted. Well, he wasn't about to let that slide.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2  (R), FORMER U.S. PRESIDENT AND 2024 PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE: I've gone 48 days now without a rest, and I've got that loser who doesn't have the energy of a rabbit. Let me tell you something, she should have been last night with the Catholics, so all they do is put out soundbites. Tell me when you've seen me take even a little bit of a risk, not only am I -- not -- I'm not even tired, I'm really exhilarated. You know why, we're killing her in the polls.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: Well, being with him in Butler, I can tell you, his schedule is insane, and he's always the guy who's most energetic at the end of the day. But Trump is leading in the RealClearPolitics average of battleground states by 0.8 percentage points, now that's a change. This is what the RCP battleground map looks like, and this is just out today. It has Trump winning with 312 electoral votes to Har