ains very real. In Afghanistan, al-Qaeda is rebuilding in proximity to billions of dollars of yes, U.S. weapons that Joe and Kamala left behind, all after Biden and Harris abandoned that country what was the most disastrous withdrawal in American history. But, remember, Kamala was the last person in the room and she's very comfortable with that disastrous decision.\par \par \uc2 But back here at home, individuals linked to \uc2 ISIS\uc2 , other terror groups, they're now crossing our wide open southern border in alarming numbers. Now, some have been apprehended, many others remain at large in the U.S. We have no idea where they are.\par \par \uc2 Harris-Biden, no idea where they are. They have refused repeatedly the requests by the media and others to reveal what countries they come from. I pray to God and I mean this as we think of the 23rd anniversary of 9/11, I pray to God I'm wrong. I doubt I am.\par \par \uc2 These unvetted Harris-Biden illegals with known terror ties from Iran, Syria, Egypt, Afghanistan, from China, Russia, Venezuela, they are plotting, they are planning, they are scheming future terror attacks on our homeland and even \uc2 FBI\uc2  Director Wray has been saying as much.\par \par \uc2 It's not a matter of when -- well, it is a matter of when, not a matter of if. I pray to God I'm wrong.\par \par \uc2 They will have blood on their hands, just like they do over every American that has been murdered and raped by their unvetted illegal immigrants over 11 million that they have allowed into this country, the illegals that Kamala wants to decriminalize, provide free housing, health care, education.\par \par \uc2 Now, taxpayer funded --\par \par \uc2 (AUDIO GAP)\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right. By the way, apologies. We do have things in television occasionally it's called technical difficulties and apparently, something knocked us off the air, probably a left-wing radical liberal conspiracy -- at least I'd say that if I was \uc2 Hillary Clinton\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Anyway, welcome back. We're glad you're with us. I don't really believe that for you idiots in the media that will print that tomorrow.\par \par \uc2 Look, these are serious times and if these illegals that are unvetted get into this country and they kill Americans, they will have blood on their hands, just like they do over every American that has been murdered and raped by unvetted Harris-Biden illegals, over 11 million from over 180 countries they have allowed into our country, the illegals that Kamala wants to decriminalize, provide free housing, health care, education, now taxpayer-funded sex changes and amnesty on top of it?\par \par \uc2 These policies are extreme. They are radical. They are dangerous.\par \par \uc2 This is a presidential candidate who actually called on Americans to have the courage -- think of this -- 9/11/01, 23 years ago and she's saying we need to have the courage to stop using the term "radical Islamic terrorism" and "illegal alien".\par \par \uc2 As America's borders czar, radical extremist \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , she is solely responsible for letting people with terror ties and these criminals that have committed murder and rape and other violent crimes and gangs to pour into our country from all over the world.\par \par \uc2 Now, during last night's debate, we didn't hear of Kamala on the border crisis, or so many other important issues. How is it possible we didn't get an answer on Kamala's plan to decriminalize illegal immigration and offer all of these taxpayer funded benefits or her flip-flops on the border wall that she laughed at as a vanity project and defunding ICE.\par \par \uc2 Now, we knew about her taxpayer-funded healthcare, housing, education amnesty plans but think about this -- taxpayers, that's all of you, funded gender reassignment surgery for illegal immigrants and convicts. How is it possible we didn't get a straight answer on the $93 trillion green new deal that she would eliminate the filibuster to pass and that she co-sponsored with Bernie Sanders or government-run healthcare and the elimination of all private health insurance? Again, both bills she co-sponsored with Bernie Sanders.\par \par \uc2 Or her very radical statement in August of '23, that we call it Bidenomics and she's very proud of it or the fact that we have inflation that has been over 20 percent since she's been in office. I'm going to fix this on day one. Okay, day one was a long time ago.\par \par \uc2 Or radical proposals to raise taxes through the roof, including unrealized capital gains? Even \uc2 Mark Cuban\uc2  realizes that'll ruin the economy.\par \par \uc2 How is it possible last night, ABC Disney didn't demand an answer on Kamala support of defund, dismantle, no bail? How is it possible not a single question about Kamala's promotion of a bail fund that got violent offenders and rioters out of jail? Nearly 600 riots in the summer of 2020, and she says the rioters won't stop, shouldn't stop and she won't stop supporting these rioters and insurrectionists.\par \par \uc2 ABC Disney, they weren't interested in holding Kamala's feet to the fire, because their CEO \uc2 Bob Iger\uc2 , his heir apparent as well, ABC Disney, they want \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  to be elected. Well, that was very clear last night. In fact, last night was little more than a campaign contribution by ABC Disney masquerading as a news division which they are not, all while supporting the Harris campaign.\par \par \uc2 ABC News is a left-wing woke leftist talk network, but they're not honest. And what was the most overt sickening display of left-wing bias during a presidential debate, the so-called moderators barely asked the vice president about any massive flip-flops, changes in position, only since she became the presumptive Democratic nominee, never once followed up on when she provide -- failed to provide a straight answer. Does she or does she not support any restrictions on late term abortion? I'd still like to know.\par \par \uc2 You know, in contrast, former President Trump got nothing but hostile treatment from the moderators, constant follow-ups, fact checks, gotcha questions, kind of like this.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 LINSEY DAVIS, ABC NEWS MODERATOR: There is no state in this country where it is legal to kill a baby after it's born. Now, Madam Vice President, I want to get your response to President Trump.\par \par \uc2 DAVID MUIR, ABC NEWS MODERATOR: ABC News did reach out to the city manager there. He told us there have been no credible reports, and the Springfield city manager says there's no evidence of that.\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2 , FORMER U.S. PRESIDENT & 2024 PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE: We'll find out.\par \par \uc2 MUIR: Vice President Harris, I'll let you respond to the rest of what you've heard.\par \par \uc2 President Trump as you know, the \uc2 FBI\uc2  says,, overall, violent crime is actually coming down in this country.\par \par \uc2 The question was about you as president not about former Speaker Pelosi, but I do want Vice President Harris to respond here.\par \par \uc2 DAVIS: Vice President Harris, he says you hate Israel.\par \par \uc2 KAMALA HARRIS\uc2 , VICE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES & 2024 PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE: Oh, that's absolutely not true.\par \par \uc2 MUIR: You said she went to negotiate with \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 . Vice President Harris, have you ever met \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 ? Can you clarify tonight?\par \par \uc2 DAVIS: Just a yes or no, you still do not have a plan?\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right. So guess how many times these moderators fact check \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 ? Zero, not once.\par \par \uc2 Make no mistake: she lied over and over and over again. Just take a look at your screen, she lied about project 25, lied about the very fine people hoax in Charlottesville, that even left-wing snoops called out as a lie, said it wa